<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX Dec gold - down $0.50 to $1.00 an ounce.</p>
<p>COMEX Sept silver - down 1.0 to 2.0 cents</p>
<p>NYMEX Oct platinum - down $4.00 to $5.00</p>
<p>NYMEX Sept palladium - off $1.00</p>
<p>COMEX Sept copper - unchanged</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
